391", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974471_782428476616724_1116172443318779459_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V2XNzJvxlKsQ7kNvwHUbqma&_nc_oc=AdrLgiKSe30pSHRoUx8nh-66VjtwySw9O9ovm8HpctJihGR3ShIdX7doAY9Ru5TaQn0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8TnCfbueFSauieQ0DLCmgwfff_NAaMuvSiCwHbo7q4aw&oe=6A37F311"}, {"file_name": "scr_4.png", "id": "159298223794289", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_159298230460955_160499850208589564_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I_wDPsYwlGEQ7kNvwEk1m51&_nc_oc=AdofoMP9OSx-Lx_i1A9afBPhgMXT1Gej005vBrfwrxgaX15fKdM28i4t08hz_JImYrI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-U8ueiI-D-LgfJtDvMx1RW1zrB9MKIjCjKweB4WtFULQ&oe=6A37FADD"}, {"file_name": "scr_3.png", "id": "1622890074875818", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_1622890078209151_210179435196440368_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ls6A5Gy-4IIQ7kNvwFm1DJi&_nc_oc=Adqg76wYqQCxAPVIQATY_h7-M14dvWo8uGNt5D-Jjh4YoKDRKHVuvE_A2-D5wBF38hI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af80rFXWwKrQWi_FNi_AFKGmZRIJJ2bV58MZIBcKnjD7uQ&oe=6A37EDB9"}, {"file_name": "scr_2.png", "id": "177703811915843", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_177703815249176_1528287960455225088_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cmX3DRBhtu8Q7kNvwFUfGFM&_nc_oc=Adqi0ZpQTZqwvlGqsb3-ldtKm0PJYIbvpcuZl3jaLi94XpXYqBEHi1cSg_c0q64vFRk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_abgtozb0bLSuk2zlOLqZgEK3v411MDe_W0jmZ1CtJDA&oe=6A38144A"}, {"file_name": "scr_5.png", "id": "808935813774196", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031332_808935817107529_8861221418933832083_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x-P2M80EoS4Q7kNvwHGxrj_&_nc_oc=Adq3eR4Y9fAtTI7j4CpBvL8b2jXGXDCLu8C16RDOviCA1J9_fpNmkoUM1XygDaBk6pI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_3K4_7TAWo7re8AXovDK6azPKLpSzoSVi_6BxGjgZdSg&oe=6A38151C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The king is gone", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In this game, you have to run away. Different doors are blocking the way, that need to be unlocked to proceed as fast as possible. Each door will give a different benefit, and a combination of them is the key to succeed .. or fail.\n\nTo open a door, a puzzle is presented, where pieces of a key have to be rotated and merged together to open the door. The further you run, the more difficult the key puzzles become.\n\nThere are three different modes:\n\n* Normal Mode: Score is increasing the more you survive. It decreases the more you stay idle in a room without picking a door. There's a set amount of rooms to complete before reaching the end.\n* Endless Mode: Score increases with each room that is completed. There is no end to the amount of rooms presented.\n* Random Mode: Each door has a specific score as a reward when opened. Rooms and their rewards spawn at random.\n\nThe available benefits from the doors are:\n\n* Green doors: Increase running speed.\n* Purple doors: Increase lock-picking skills, which makes opening new doors easier.\n* Blue doors: Gives extra chances before losing.\n* Brown doors provide no direct benefit, apart from helping complete more rooms.", "short_description": "A puzzle game about running, not because one has somewhere to be, but because one has somewhere they don't want to be."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://afloofdev.com/privacy_policy/games/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Afloofdev", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.afloofdev.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "37